&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director, Facilities,&amp;nbsp; the Workplace Services Manager will be responsible for a wide range of activities; office moves, daily facilities and workplace operations, event coordination, space planning, implementing a Facility Management System and other logistical needs. We are looking for someone with exceptional leadership, customer-service, and facilities expertise. Our goal is to provide a great workplace experience where all Robloxians can operate efficiently and effectively in a clean, safe and fun environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role is based in San Mateo, CA from Monday through Friday&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the daily operations of our San Mateo offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a hospitality-oriented, forward-thinking, data-driven workplace strategy focused on cultivating success across Roblox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient Management in Space Planning for Roblox HQ, including small satellite offices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle hospitality and service operations for our employees (cafe, coffee bar, events..)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with Exec Admins and support staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise employees (and/or subcontractors/outside vendors) involved in building/facilities activities like cleaning, event planning, ergonomics, space utilization and strategy, and office supplies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide, coach and educate team for increased efficiencies &amp;amp; growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively leverage data and analytic capabilities to help manage daily operations and operate strategically for future growth and consistency across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and collaborate with internal stakeholders (e.g. IT, People Operations, etc) and external vendors to ensure alignment, updating occupancy reports, and onboarding/offboarding protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish, supervise execute plans on space planning, seat assignments (moves, adds, and changes) to optimize space utilization and business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage ergonomics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offsite parking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the implementation and daily operation of Facilities Management System&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle administrative functions including tracking of all expenses, PO creation and monitoring, ordering and maintaining supplies and preparing reports on activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and deliver world-class events with various employee groups to schedule, facilitate and plan employee events such as Roblox Week, Hack Week, happy hour, special holiday events and intern events during the summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Safety Team with activities such as&amp;nbsp; coordinating fire drills, emergency procedures, etc. also enforcing safety rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver Process and Procedure standards for office improvements in workflow, physical operations, and vendor protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and be flexible to ensure the success of the overall facilities team and ensure we are creating a workplace where employees are engaged and productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively build and manage relationships internally and with external vendors (e.g. property management)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duties may require work during evenings and weekend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 rotating on call schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 10+ years of experience in workplace or corporate facilities environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 7+ years of experience leading teams of people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively organize, work, and lead teams in a fast-paced environment under constantly changing priorities and demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective in developing and coaching a team of Robloxians&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Google Suite and technological tools, AutoCAD light, or experience with drafting test fits and layouts preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read design and construction documents, specs, and plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills in being productive and effective with minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent for building relationships and provide a white glove service approach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in being resourceful, exhibit grace under pressure, and know you’re capable of finding solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent in communicating with all levels within the organization; written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in staying organized and with excellent multi-tasking ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in the details to ensure timely and accurate completion of tasks, responsibilities, and projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to document for increased efficiency and consistency across the team and company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duties require work during evenings and weekend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$145,630&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$178,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a versatile marketing leader to manage our marketing engagement across Europe. As our first local marketing person in the region, you will design and execute a comprehensive GTM strategy that accounts for the diverse cultural, economic, and linguistic landscape of Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for identifying high-growth clusters, navigating complex regulatory environments, and building a unified brand voice that resonates across multiple borders. Your work will span social, influencers, partner, and event marketing. You will be the fulcrum of all the region&#39;s outbound activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Netherlands (plus a few weeks at HQ for an extended orientation)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic Regional Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Design a scalable marketing framework that can be adapted for Tier 1 European markets (high volume/established) and Tier 2/3 markets (high growth).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localized Content Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the &quot;transcreation&quot; and localization of all marketing assets. While English is our core working language, you will ensure our brand voice translates with native-level nuance across key European regions, leveraging your German or French skills where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile GTM Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead product launches across Europe, prioritizing markets based on data, barriers to entry, and localized product-market fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Border Community &amp;amp; Influencer Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage regional social media and platform trends to build a loyal community through targeted influencer partnerships and localized channels (Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy &amp;amp; Comms Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with legal and policy teams to navigate the varied regulatory landscapes of Europe, ensuring absolute compliance with GDPR and local data privacy standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event &amp;amp; Ecosystem Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop locally relevant events and community initiatives across key priority European markets, while also participating in existing industry events that support relationship building, market understanding and ecosystem growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Market Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and develop trusted partnerships with brands, NGOs, across key European markets to strengthen local credibility, relevance and long-term growth, while deepening engagement with creators, industry stakeholders and broader market ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of marketing experience&lt;/strong&gt; with a deep, pan-regional focus across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to operate autonomously within a strategic framework, driving clear outcomes with minimal day-to-day oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Absolute professional fluency in English. The ability to understand, speak, or review content in German and/or French is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Broad Market Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing marketing efforts in highly fragmented environments—from varying audience demographics and cultural perceptions to distinct European economic climates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years in Consumer Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the European consumer journey, specifically privacy-first user behaviors, mobile trends, and local trust barriers.&lt;/li&gt;
