&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Passionate about the developer experience, informed by deep technical knowledge, productivity tooling experience, and a customer-focused mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experienced leading cross-functional efforts at scale, aligning teams across a company and driving complex technical initiatives to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A technical leader excited to mentor engineers at all levels and elevate the team through your evangelism of best practices, architectural thinking, and engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
