&lt;li&gt;A lifelong learner: constantly seeking new knowledge and techniques to grow your expertise and expand your impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent and self-directed: capable of charting a course with minimal guidance, and comfortable making decisions in uncertain situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative: effective at working with cross-functional partners and teams, and skilled at building consensus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion: dedicated to fostering a workplace where everyone feels valued, supported, and able to contribute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about cutting-edge ML tech: knowledgeable about the latest advances in AI/ML and excited to apply these technologies to keep users safe.&lt;/li&gt;
