&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer on the Ads &amp;amp; Brands team, you will shape the future of monetization at Roblox by designing for our core Ads Platform and Tooling. You will build complex, scalable systems that power both sides of&amp;nbsp; our market: helping advertisers launch high-impact campaigns while empowering creators to maximize their earnings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of deep systems thinking, business impact, and high-craft UX/UI. You will partner with cross-functional teams across Product, Engineering, Research, and Data Science to deliver experiences that balance player delight, creator opportunity, and brand value. You will play a pivotal role in driving revenue growth, enhancing developer earnings, and transforming multi-faceted ecosystems into intuitive, powerful tools. This role reports to the Senior Manager of Product Design, Ads &amp;amp; Brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define UX strategy and design direction for Roblox’s Ads Platform and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve complex, end-to-end experiences that help advertisers launch impactful campaigns and creators maximize their earning potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, Research, and Data Science to translate business goals and user needs into intuitive, effective product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and strong intuition to identify opportunities, validate design direction, and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype and iterate on complex interactions in Figma,&amp;nbsp; Ai prototyping tool and, when needed, Roblox Studio to bring concepts to life and test ideas quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Foundation Design Systems and other design teams to ensure consistency, scalability, and a high bar for craft across Ads experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguity and influence product strategy, helping shape solutions across a multi-faceted ecosystem with many interconnected users and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate design strategy, rationale, and tradeoffs clearly to cross-functional partners and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to design culture through mentorship, critique, and raising the bar for product thinking, systems thinking, and craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the unique needs of players, creators, and brands to design experiences that create mutual value across the ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in product design, with a proven track record of shipping consumer-facing, platform, or complex B2B products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating exceptional interaction and visual design craft, paired with strong product, systems, and strategic thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing complex workflows, platforms, or tools that serve multiple user types and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Figma, and confidence in prototyping complex, multi-state interactions and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with advertising, commerce, monetization, creator platforms, marketplaces, or other multi-sided ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate ambiguity, influence cross-functional decisions, and balance user needs with business goals and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and storytelling skills, with the ability to articulate design strategy and rationale to both working teams and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for immersive platforms, gaming, user-generated content, or tools that enable people to create and express themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$255,720&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$304,560 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you’ll be a key member of the Safety design team, playing a critical role in building the systems that keep Roblox safe, civil, and inclusive for a global community. You’ll focus on creating platform-level designs and frameworks that support users in moments of need and uphold community standards across the entire Roblox ecosystem, across Creator, Player, and Brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox’s mission is to connect a billion people with optimism and civility. The safety organization is at the heart of that mission, working to detect, remove, and prevent problematic content and behavior at scale. We also ensure account security, platform compliance with global regulations, and a healthy, inclusive environment for users of all ages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll collaborate closely with cross-functional teams across product, engineering, and research, shaping the platform&#39;s approach to trust and safety through thoughtful design. This is an opportunity to work at the systems level—defining how safety is embedded across Roblox and designing reusable frameworks that power our vision of civil immersive online communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clear, compelling, and empathetic experiences that help users understand how safety’s policies, processes, and systems are applied across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for diverse audiences—young users, teens, adults, brands, and developers—ensuring critical safety journeys are accessible, age-appropriate, and effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Foundation Design Systems team to develop scalable, reusable patterns across safety features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, research, and experimentation to develop a deep understanding of user behavior—especially in moments of confusion, conflict, or rule-breaking—to inform design decisions and improve reform outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with policy, product, and engineering teams to ensure quality, strategic alignment,and best-in-class user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define the UX strategy and roadmap for flagship safety experiences that guide users toward safe, civil behavior on Roblox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in HCI, Interaction Design, Design, or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience (8+ years) in UX/UI design, with a strong track record of delivering impactful systems-level thinking and launching innovative consumer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing exceptional design skills and user-centered design thinking. Direct trust &amp;amp; safety experience is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking with the ability to understand and design for complex workflows and interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance business objectives, user needs, and technical constraints in design solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker who can design scalable frameworks for brand expression and player engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative partner who thrives in multidisciplinary environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-craft designer who sweats the details while staying anchored in strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curious explorer eager to push what’s possible for brands in an immersive, creator-driven platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$214,710&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$255,720 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every day, Roblox users play over 7M experiences, make over 270M avatar updates, send 6+ billion chat messages and talk for 1+ million hours using voice. Safety is Roblox’s top priority. As part of the Safety Group, the Content and Communications Safety team builds AI features and tools to automate review and moderation of all of these activities on the platform. Areas that the Content Safety Team works on include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The components that make up those experiences (textures, 3D meshes, models, scripts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avatars, Avatar items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audio, Video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text chat and voice conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;and other content types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager on the team, you will work closely with leadership, product, engineering, data science, and operations teams across Roblox. In addition, you will drive critical company-level KPIs that affect how Roblox keeps the platform safe and civil. As we bring new immersive features and content types to Roblox, you will be responsible for leading the product in one of the most challenging and vital roles at Roblox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead safety features focused on automation of content reviews by leveraging AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay one step ahead of malicious actors and their adversarial tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across many modalities of Machine Learning (image, text, audio, video, 3D, code)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure our users have a great experience end to end when they are creating content on the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve problems that are unique in the industry due to the large population of younger users on Roblox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and manage product requirements from conception to launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance input from a wide variety of internal stakeholders and partners with potentially competing priorities and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in product development roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building and deploying AI-based solutions at a large scale and in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Trust &amp;amp; Safety related functions or other areas with adversarial dynamics. Preferably in a user generated content environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of social platforms (familiarity with game engines would be a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extreme clarity in communication. Ability to summarize complex situations in a few sentences and effectively articulate your vision to c-staff level executives, cross functional partners, and other key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic and flexible mindset, creating opportunity out of uncertainty and ambiguity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$280,540&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$330,950 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
