&lt;li&gt;Own projects end-to-end: from design and architecture through production and long-term reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar on engineering standards through rigorous design, testing, and diligent code review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with teams across Roblox, including Game Engine, Creator, and Safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers on the team and contribute to recruiting future talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
