&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer on the User Communities team, you’ll own the backend systems that power social engagement features, such as Announcements, Forums, Polls, Bug Reporting, and more, for millions of players, as well as the control plane, permissions layer, and tools for Creators to build, grow, and moderate thriving communities on Roblox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your day-to-day will focus on building and scaling the systems that bring players and Creators together, both inside and outside the experience. On the player side, that means creating places where people can find and connect with other members of the community, such as having conversations about the experience, discovering the latest updates, and sharing their feedback. On the Creator side, that means giving them the tools and controls to shape those spaces, including configuring custom roles, creating content, moderating discussions, and converting organic excitement into lasting engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Getting there means driving architectural decisions, reasoning through trade-offs, influencing stakeholders, championing user-first safety standards, and defining developer-facing APIs that help creators make more engaging spaces. You&#39;ll work closely with frontend and backend engineers, product, design, and data scientists across teams, and you&#39;ll have real influence over our technical and product direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re an experienced engineer who gets excited about large-scale distributed systems and wants to shape the way millions of people connect inside virtual worlds, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You Will:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the backend engineering culture across the Communities team. Your influence extends beyond your immediate pod to improve how we build, review, and ship software across the entire org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical lead for cross-functional initiatives. Collaborate across multiple pods alongside product, design and both frontend and backend engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of projects. Drive initiatives from the creation of comprehensive technical plans and architecture through to successful launch, iteration, and measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be hands-on in the codebase. Our senior engineers actively develop the platform and review the code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design empowering systems. Build architectures that enable Roblox creators and players to actively engage with each other both in-experience as well as on the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote exploration and experimentation among engineers, advocating for new technologies and flows that promote user experience, with a safety-first mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You Have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of backend software engineering experience, with demonstrated ownership of large-scale production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong distributed systems fundamentals — experience architecting and operating large, complex systems that handle high throughput&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in at least one server-side language (e.g., C#, Java, C++) and comfort navigating large, complex codebases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to author clear technical specs, reason about trade-offs that hold up at scale, and influence teams towards the correct collective architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of broad system architecture — from ambiguous requirements through production, including cross-functional coordination with product, and alignment with multiple engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering fundamentals — code quality, test coverage, observability (logging, metrics, alerting), and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You Are:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kind and generous: You treat colleagues with respect, assume good intent, and go out of your way to help others succeed. You believe technical excellence without kindness is not enough.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product-opinionated: You don&#39;t just execute plans, you proactively shape our roadmap, and push for the right product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on: You write code, review code, and stay close to the product. You&#39;re not looking for a role where you stop building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI advocate: You actively push the boundaries of AI-assisted development for yourself and your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously growing: You take pride in your craft and hold yourself to a higher standard each quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$243,290&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$295,250 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY SAFETY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Roblox, we strive to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and the Safety organization’s mission is to become the leader in civil immersive online communities. We systematically detect, remove, and prevent problematic accounts, content and behavior, and we make Roblox accounts secure and free from compromise. We cover a broad area of the tech spectrum, including machine learning, classifiers for 3D models, experimentation, automation, detection workflows, and AI-powered text filters. Aligned and partnering with product teams, we use this toolbelt to discover new opportunities, influence and shape the product roadmap and prioritization, build safety products, and measure the impact on our community of users and developers. In doing so, we keep Roblox safe, civil, and inclusive, and we foster positive relationships between people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOT DEFENSE?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox is a prime target for automated scripts that cause harm to our users, and creators. Join our Bots and Spam team, where you will tackle the critical challenge of safeguarding the platform against sophisticated bot threats.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While our current team Backend and ML engineers have made tremendous progress in improving our detection quality and mitigation efficacy, we have reached a critical inflection point. To move from reactive firefighting to a hardened, self-serve platform, we need the missing piece of our puzzle: &lt;strong&gt;you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;founding Senior Full-Stack Engineer (Frontend focus)&lt;/strong&gt; on the bot defense team, to strengthen our in-house Bot Defense solutions at Roblox.&amp;nbsp;As a full-stack engineer on our team, you will bridge the gap between our advanced ML and backend solutions by building intuitive, scalable, and high-performance &lt;strong&gt;front-end user interactions&lt;/strong&gt; to bring these defenses to life. You will have a direct impact on platform health, ensuring fairness for creators and players by staying ahead of evolving threats in a high-stakes, data-driven environment.&amp;nbsp; If you are passionate about solving complex, high-impact problems in an adversarial landscape, this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just a traditional coding role; it is a platform-building role. If you want to solve complex, high-stakes problems with a team that has already proven its ability to deliver major technical milestones, we want to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The &quot;Founding&quot; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You will have total autonomy to shape our frontend practices. As the first dedicated full-stack hire on the team, you will have the opportunity to drive and establish next-generation technical and quality standards for the team’s frontend stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visible Results:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop high-quality, user-centric, and low-friction front-end solutions, applying an adversarial and data-driven lens to proactively address security vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge the gap:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex backend detection intelligence into intuitive, high-value interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a centralized platform to provide intuitive UX for the bot defense pod and access control options to various product teams within Roblox and to the wider creator community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the toughest problems:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and deploy 0-1 secure, efficient, and reliable bot defense products, focusing on the user experience for bot detection and mitigation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience as a Fullstack Software Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in front-end development of hands-on experience with UI scripting languages and modern frameworks, such as JavaScript, TypeScript, Lua, and React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in compiled backend languages such as Golang, Java, or C#.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equivalent experience or a BS in Computer Science, Applied Math, Physics, Engineering, Statistics, or another technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong focus on writing clear, readable, testable, and highly monitored code.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first mindset demonstrated through exceptional cross-team collaboration and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$243,290 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Consumer App Foundation team is looking for a Senior Software Engineer to improve Roblox performance across our supported platforms. Our platform is used by over 150M people daily. You will work primarily in cross-platform C++ Roblox game engine code, partnering with teams across the company to identify bottlenecks, ship measurable improvements, and prevent regressions over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is responsible for the end-to-end performance of the Roblox client on Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, Xbox, Playstation and TV. We tackle the platform’s most difficult technical constraints, ranging from speed and responsiveness to efficiency and stability, to ensure a high-performance experience across all of our devices and platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end performance of the Roblox client across all platforms directly moving the needle on our key metrics: TTI, app size, battery usage and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the benchmarking, profiling, and telemetry systems required to catch regressions early and continue scaling our application even further.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with stakeholders across Engineering, Product, and Design to evaluate technical tradeoffs, align on company-wide priorities, and execute smooth rollout plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive deep technical impact by diving into complex, unfamiliar codebases, taking ambitious projects from greenfield MVP to production-grade, and mentoring peers on performance best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience writing high-quality, performant C++ code in large, complex codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building reliable measurement, monitoring, or regression prevention systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to autonomously navigate complex, ambiguous systems and deliver stable, production-grade software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills to discuss technical trade-offs with both engineering peers and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with on-device profiling (iOS and/or Android) to find and measure optimization opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,780&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$242,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
