&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience operating infrastructure at consumer-internet scale (100M+ users).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
