&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and scale reliable infrastructure and platform solutions that protect user data and support the needs of a global platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop foundational capabilities for emerging technologies, including agentic AI workflows, with a focus on safe and responsible data access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering teams across Roblox to integrate scalable data protection capabilities into their systems and development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical strategy and architecture for complex, cross-cutting challenges spanning data, infrastructure, privacy, and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of proven experience as a software engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Python or Golang;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of system design, reliability, scalability, and data management principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in applying your engineering expertise to data protection and privacy challenges; prior domain experience is a plus, but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
