&lt;p&gt;The Experience LiveOps (ELO) Team builds the runtime tools creators use to operate and tune their live experiences without shipping a code release. Our surfaces include Remote Configs (targeted, scheduled, and AI-assisted configuration), A/B Experimentation with real metrics and early harm detection, audience Segmentation, and Open Cloud / public APIs that expose all of it programmatically.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and ship features across ELO&#39;s config, experimentation, and segmentation surfaces, backend services &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; the creator-hub UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects end-to-end (spec to launch) with support from senior/principal engineers on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with PM, design, DSA/Discovery, and Data Platform to deliver high-quality, well-instrumented features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, share knowledge with teammates, and take part in the team&#39;s on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engineer with 1-3 years of experience building software systems (industry experience).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack-comfortable:&lt;/strong&gt; you can move between backend services and a web frontend (TypeScript/React), and you&#39;re not afraid to learn the half you know less well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A finisher:&lt;/strong&gt; you take features from spec through launch with guidance from senior teammates, and you care that they keep working — testing, monitoring, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic &amp;amp; collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt; you communicate clearly, ask good questions, and are low-ego about code and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; you stay current and like understanding &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; a system behaves the way it does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$153,120&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,750 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
